{"product_id":"speed-freaks","title":"Speed freaks","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eButterfly effect: The scientific theory that a single occurence, no matter how small, can change the course of the universe forever.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA father and son diving off the coast of Hawaii, with the sharks closing in. A scientist in a forest under attack from a savage bear. A young girl who has been kidnapped by drug dealers in Rio. The teenagers surfing on top of a speeding bullet train.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor them, and many others, things will never be the same again.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSome will live. Many will die. All are connected.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe action is non-stop in this tense and compelling adventure.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions:17 x 200 \u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Matt Dickinson \u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780192757142 \u003cbr\u003eFormat: \u003cbr\u003ePages 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43403648204953,"sku":"9RB9780192757142","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/spp.jpg?v=1752150937","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/speed-freaks","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}